==Cebuano==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ceb|es|semana}}, from {{etyl|osp|ceb}} {{m|osp|setmana}}, from {{etyl|LL.|ceb}} {{m|la|septimāna}}, from {{etyl|la|ceb}} {{m|la|septimus||seventh}}, from {{m|la|septem||seven}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ceb}} {{m|ine-pro|*septḿ̥}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|se|ma|na|lang=ceb}}

===Noun===
{{head|ceb|noun}}

# A [[week]]; a [[period]] of [[seven]] days beginning with [[Sunday]] or [[Monday]].
# Any period of seven [[consecutive]] days.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|a week}} {{l|ceb|pitlaw}}

